{"id":"forecast-04","section":2,"path":"bank/listening/forecast-04/audio-2.mp3","model":"small","duration":427.36,"segments":[{"start":0.24,"end":7.86,"text":"Section 2. You will hear a woman called Marie talking at a conference to a group of people","words":[["Section",0.24,0.88],["2.",0.88,1.46],["You",2.3,2.96],["will",2.96,3.12],["hear",3.12,3.28],["a",3.28,3.4],["woman",3.4,3.6],["called",3.6,4.0],["Marie",4.0,4.54],["talking",4.54,5.6],["at",5.6,5.88],["a",5.88,5.98],["conference",5.98,6.44],["to",6.44,7.04],["a",7.04,7.2],["group",7.2,7.36],["of",7.36,7.58],["people",7.58,7.86]]},{"start":7.86,"end":15.36,"text":"who work in the hospitality industry in Scotland. First, you have some time to look at questions","words":[["who",7.86,8.16],["work",8.16,8.4],["in",8.4,8.6],["the",8.6,8.74],["hospitality",8.74,9.22],["industry",9.22,10.14],["in",10.14,10.66],["Scotland.",10.66,11.06],["First,",12.34,13.06],["you",13.42,13.68],["have",13.68,13.86],["some",13.86,14.06],["time",14.06,14.42],["to",14.42,14.68],["look",14.68,14.82],["at",14.82,14.96],["questions",14.96,15.36]]},{"start":15.36,"end":43.44,"text":"11 to 14 on page 3. Now listen carefully and answer questions 11 to 14.","words":[["11",15.36,16.1],["to",16.1,16.58],["14",16.58,17.1],["on",17.1,17.82],["page",17.82,18.06],["3.",18.06,18.54],["Now",38.96,39.32],["listen",39.32,39.64],["carefully",39.64,40.14],["and",40.14,40.8],["answer",40.8,41.1],["questions",41.1,41.56],["11",41.56,42.38],["to",42.38,42.92],["14.",42.92,43.44]]},{"start":43.44,"end":52.86,"text":"Hi, my name's Marie Cooper and I'm here to tell you about the scholarships offered by","words":[["Hi,",43.44,44.82],["my",48.2,48.56],["name's",48.56,49.04],["Marie",49.04,49.26],["Cooper",49.26,49.62],["and",49.62,50.22],["I'm",50.22,50.5],["here",50.5,50.64],["to",50.64,50.82],["tell",50.82,51.02],["you",51.02,51.16],["about",51.16,51.38],["the",51.38,51.62],["scholarships",51.62,52.0],["offered",52.0,52.56],["by",52.56,52.86]]},{"start":52.86,"end":58.7,"text":"the hospitality industry in Scotland. The scholarship scheme supports people currently","words":[["the",52.86,52.98],["hospitality",52.98,53.4],["industry",53.4,54.24],["in",54.24,54.66],["Scotland.",54.66,55.08],["The",56.14,56.36],["scholarship",56.36,56.66],["scheme",56.66,57.26],["supports",57.26,57.64],["people",57.64,58.18],["currently",58.18,58.7]]},{"start":58.7,"end":65.78,"text":"working in hotels, resorts and tourist attractions. Each year, a hundred people are selected to","words":[["working",58.7,59.06],["in",59.06,59.44],["hotels,",59.44,59.76],["resorts",60.24,60.6],["and",60.6,61.08],["tourist",61.08,61.42],["attractions.",61.42,61.9],["Each",62.94,63.4],["year,",63.4,63.68],["a",64.06,64.1],["hundred",64.1,64.34],["people",64.34,64.74],["are",64.74,65.1],["selected",65.1,65.48],["to",65.48,65.78]]},{"start":65.78,"end":72.02,"text":"go and work in some of the leading hospitality organisations in the world. This time last","words":[["go",65.78,65.98],["and",65.98,66.12],["work",66.12,66.42],["in",66.42,66.8],["some",66.8,66.98],["of",66.98,67.14],["the",67.14,67.3],["leading",67.3,67.58],["hospitality",67.58,68.14],["organisations",68.14,69.08],["in",69.08,69.42],["the",69.42,69.5],["world.",69.5,69.8],["This",70.86,71.38],["time",71.38,71.7],["last",71.7,72.02]]},{"start":72.02,"end":77.78,"text":"year I was wondering whether to apply for a scholarship and not sure if I had enough experience","words":[["year",72.02,72.38],["I",72.38,73.06],["was",73.06,73.26],["wondering",73.26,73.64],["whether",73.64,73.98],["to",73.98,74.2],["apply",74.2,74.58],["for",74.58,74.82],["a",74.82,74.94],["scholarship",74.94,75.36],["and",75.36,75.92],["not",75.92,76.14],["sure",76.14,76.48],["if",76.48,76.74],["I",76.74,76.86],["had",76.86,77.06],["enough",77.06,77.26],["experience",77.26,77.78]]},{"start":77.78,"end":83.94,"text":"to be successful. I needn't have worried. The scholarship is open to people of all ages","words":[["to",77.78,78.12],["be",78.12,78.28],["successful.",78.28,78.88],["I",79.48,79.74],["needn't",79.74,80.08],["have",80.08,80.2],["worried.",80.2,80.52],["The",81.26,81.44],["scholarship",81.44,81.86],["is",81.86,82.14],["open",82.14,82.46],["to",82.46,82.68],["people",82.68,82.92],["of",82.92,83.12],["all",83.12,83.48],["ages",83.48,83.94]]},{"start":83.94,"end":89.72,"text":"working full time in the industry. The only stipulation is that you need to have worked","words":[["working",83.94,84.34],["full",84.34,84.76],["time",84.76,85.08],["in",85.08,85.38],["the",85.38,85.5],["industry.",85.5,85.96],["The",86.84,87.1],["only",87.1,87.32],["stipulation",87.32,87.96],["is",87.96,88.66],["that",88.66,88.8],["you",88.8,88.96],["need",88.96,89.1],["to",89.1,89.28],["have",89.28,89.44],["worked",89.44,89.72]]},{"start":89.72,"end":96.38,"text":"for three years in hospitality, not necessarily for the same organisation. Of course, they're","words":[["for",89.72,89.92],["three",89.92,90.26],["years",90.26,90.62],["in",90.62,90.8],["hospitality,",90.8,91.38],["not",91.88,92.14],["necessarily",92.14,92.7],["for",92.7,93.14],["the",93.14,93.24],["same",93.24,93.52],["organisation.",93.52,94.12],["Of",95.14,95.42],["course,",95.42,95.74],["they're",96.12,96.38]]},{"start":96.38,"end":101.22,"text":"looking for ambitious people who want to get on but you haven't had the chance to","words":[["looking",96.38,96.6],["for",96.6,96.9],["ambitious",96.9,97.36],["people",97.36,97.96],["who",97.96,98.46],["want",98.46,98.6],["to",98.6,98.78],["get",98.78,98.88],["on",98.88,99.24],["but",99.24,99.74],["you",99.74,99.98],["haven't",99.98,100.36],["had",100.36,100.5],["the",100.5,100.62],["chance",100.62,100.94],["to",100.94,101.22]]},{"start":101.22,"end":107.18,"text":"work in management or studied at college, so there are no minimum qualifications required","words":[["work",101.22,101.44],["in",101.44,101.6],["management",101.6,102.06],["or",102.06,102.74],["studied",102.74,103.14],["at",103.14,103.32],["college,",103.32,103.72],["so",104.54,104.94],["there",104.94,105.16],["are",105.16,105.26],["no",105.26,105.48],["minimum",105.48,105.9],["qualifications",105.9,106.6],["required",106.6,107.18]]},{"start":107.18,"end":113.2,"text":"and you're just as likely to be offered a scholarship if you work for a large fancy hotel","words":[["and",107.18,108.36],["you're",108.36,108.76],["just",108.76,109.02],["as",109.02,109.28],["likely",109.28,109.58],["to",109.58,109.82],["be",109.82,109.96],["offered",109.96,110.28],["a",110.28,110.44],["scholarship",110.44,110.86],["if",110.86,111.46],["you",111.46,111.62],["work",111.62,111.86],["for",111.86,112.04],["a",112.04,112.14],["large",112.14,112.48],["fancy",112.48,112.8],["hotel",112.8,113.2]]},{"start":113.2,"end":117.08,"text":"in Edinburgh or a small family hotel in the Highlands.","words":[["in",113.2,113.5],["Edinburgh",113.5,113.88],["or",113.88,114.56],["a",114.56,114.74],["small",114.74,115.04],["family",115.04,115.44],["hotel",115.44,115.86],["in",115.86,116.42],["the",116.42,116.6],["Highlands.",116.6,117.08]]},{"start":117.98,"end":124.76,"text":"As we all know, Scotland is famous for its fishing, golf, coastline and unspoilt countryside","words":[["As",117.98,118.44],["we",118.44,118.58],["all",118.58,118.7],["know,",118.7,118.98],["Scotland",119.44,119.82],["is",119.82,120.24],["famous",120.24,120.66],["for",120.66,120.98],["its",120.98,121.14],["fishing,",121.14,121.48],["golf,",121.86,122.06],["coastline",122.44,123.0],["and",123.0,123.36],["unspoilt",123.36,124.12],["countryside",124.12,124.76]]},{"start":124.76,"end":129.98,"text":"which is why it's always been a popular destination for tourists from all over the","words":[["which",124.76,125.44],["is",125.44,125.64],["why",125.64,125.94],["it's",125.94,126.56],["always",126.56,126.9],["been",126.9,127.12],["a",127.12,127.22],["popular",127.22,127.52],["destination",127.52,128.06],["for",128.06,128.48],["tourists",128.48,128.82],["from",128.82,129.14],["all",129.14,129.54],["over",129.54,129.84],["the",129.84,129.98]]},{"start":129.98,"end":136.62,"text":"world. Something like 10% of people in Scotland depend on the Scottish hospitality industry","words":[["world.",129.98,130.28],["Something",131.26,131.56],["like",131.56,131.88],["10",131.88,132.22],["%",132.22,132.6],["of",132.6,132.88],["people",132.88,133.1],["in",133.1,133.28],["Scotland",133.28,133.64],["depend",133.64,134.42],["on",134.42,134.9],["the",134.9,135.04],["Scottish",135.04,135.34],["hospitality",135.34,135.94],["industry",135.94,136.62]]},{"start":136.62,"end":141.92,"text":"for their income, so it's vital that it continues to attract large numbers of visitors each year.","words":[["for",136.62,136.84],["their",136.84,136.98],["income,",136.98,137.42],["so",137.82,138.14],["it's",138.14,138.3],["vital",138.3,138.6],["that",138.6,138.86],["it",138.86,138.96],["continues",138.96,139.4],["to",139.4,139.62],["attract",139.62,139.9],["large",139.9,140.3],["numbers",140.3,140.58],["of",140.58,140.8],["visitors",140.8,141.06],["each",141.06,141.52],["year.",141.52,141.92]]},{"start":143.04,"end":148.56,"text":"The scholarships are a way of maintaining Scotland's reputation as a quality destination","words":[["The",143.04,143.38],["scholarships",143.38,143.84],["are",143.84,144.16],["a",144.16,144.26],["way",144.26,144.44],["of",144.44,144.68],["maintaining",144.68,145.26],["Scotland's",145.26,146.06],["reputation",146.06,146.56],["as",146.56,147.22],["a",147.22,147.36],["quality",147.36,147.72],["destination",147.72,148.56]]},{"start":149.06,"end":153.5,"text":"so that visitors to Scotland continue to have a very positive experience.","words":[["so",149.06,149.38],["that",149.38,149.56],["visitors",149.56,149.86],["to",149.86,150.2],["Scotland",150.2,150.62],["continue",150.62,151.46],["to",151.46,151.7],["have",151.7,151.88],["a",151.88,152.0],["very",152.0,152.26],["positive",152.26,152.7],["experience.",152.7,153.5]]},{"start":153.5,"end":163.54,"text":"Before you hear the rest of the talk, you have some time to look at questions 15 to 20 on","words":[["Before",153.5,154.62],["you",157.5,157.84],["hear",157.84,158.04],["the",158.04,158.2],["rest",158.2,158.5],["of",158.5,158.64],["the",158.64,158.74],["talk,",158.74,159.04],["you",159.46,159.7],["have",159.7,159.84],["some",159.84,160.04],["time",160.04,160.4],["to",160.4,160.64],["look",160.64,160.76],["at",160.76,160.9],["questions",160.9,161.28],["15",161.28,162.14],["to",162.14,162.58],["20",162.58,163.04],["on",163.04,163.54]]},{"start":163.54,"end":213.78,"text":"page 4. Now listen and answer questions 15 to 20.","words":[["page",163.54,163.78],["4.",163.78,164.32],["Now",209.88,210.22],["listen",210.22,210.58],["and",210.58,211.14],["answer",211.14,211.42],["questions",211.42,211.9],["15",211.9,212.88],["to",212.88,213.3],["20.",213.3,213.78]]},{"start":217.22,"end":224.22,"text":"I currently work at the Rock Hotel in Perth as a trainee manager, but I joined as a receptionist","words":[["I",217.22,217.64],["currently",217.64,218.0],["work",218.0,218.36],["at",218.36,218.58],["the",218.58,218.68],["Rock",218.68,218.92],["Hotel",218.92,219.28],["in",219.28,219.66],["Perth",219.66,220.18],["as",220.18,220.66],["a",220.66,220.8],["trainee",220.8,221.1],["manager,",221.1,221.68],["but",222.18,222.58],["I",222.58,222.76],["joined",222.76,223.1],["as",223.1,223.4],["a",223.4,223.52],["receptionist",223.52,224.22]]},{"start":224.22,"end":229.88,"text":"five years ago. At the time, I was looking for work that fitted in with a young family","words":[["five",224.22,224.52],["years",224.52,224.86],["ago.",224.86,225.16],["At",225.88,226.24],["the",226.24,226.34],["time,",226.34,226.78],["I",227.02,227.28],["was",227.28,227.42],["looking",227.42,227.66],["for",227.66,227.86],["work",227.86,228.14],["that",228.14,228.36],["fitted",228.36,228.6],["in",228.6,228.88],["with",228.88,229.04],["a",229.04,229.18],["young",229.18,229.4],["family",229.4,229.88]]},{"start":229.88,"end":2